# This directory holds the Windows x86-64 native DLL for the Unity Editor plugin.
#
# The DLL is NOT committed to source control; it is built by CMake and copied
# here using integrations/unity/scripts/copy_plugin.ps1.
#
# After copying, configure the Plugin Inspector in the Unity Editor:
#   Any Platform : unchecked
#   Editor       : checked
#   Windows x86_64: checked
